  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the chicken breast and cook until browned and cooked through, about 5 minutes.",
    "remove the chicken from the skillet and set aside.",
    "add the garlic powder, basil, chicken broth, and heavy cream to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "bring the mixture to a simmer and let cook for 2-3 minutes, or until slightly thickened.",
    "add the cooked tagliatelle to the skillet and toss with the sauce until well coated.",
    "season with salt, black pepper, and red pepper flakes to taste.",
    "return the chicken to the skillet and toss with the tagliatelle and sauce until well combined.",
    "serve hot, topped with parmesan cheese and chopped parsley."
